//scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4zMl6TBo8kMQ7kNvwFx_GTS&_nc_oc=AdouFGUNdTKjp6peg0dKcv5tF8tbuftSrPQazfpmyqwNPZ-WiX_1V2EmTtZ5HBBg7lU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRM2Z1JQH9VLdYVoTkxNnE6Do--dcxXSiWv-zq6OQ_gzw&oe=6B086C60"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UOSQIeLr7HEQ7kNvwGIGXnM&_nc_oc=AdqA3ye8UGFfXMj1evCyLOQHBDQ8bNrN8kkydiHaA6c73U5EqoOIBnXuPaj9OeRmN5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ5VogwJpiq2sENeNuXLxbRpYCwNcwEbsVMz6uxNnyybQ&oe=6B083DA2"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gvn86MosSDMQ7kNvwF_E2RR&_nc_oc=AdpkCqfm9ubMcdlohrw8Sb0mU513Dmx8r0YLA_5b6XgBLxXUTmgRvcfdOO5Rnlz4gQk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQRwS4K77j1lFAuJNS0aLlysiLuVqbt_e28CA9EX3h1dQ&oe=6B086481"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=If1KHybRpTEQ7kNvwHw8Vrt&_nc_oc=Adp37Ik_99Vq_yjmIYZzbmPQ7DZcH0_iiKd_a2zk-49M43oTbrFLys5SFSynayfnl74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRPTJFN7bFhQDAAIWt-S_DwnaANMvwG8kuCYsgYmUOUnQ&oe=6B085292"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/terms", "publisher_name": "Nebulytic", "support_website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/support", "website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/", "category": null, "c